  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production FAQs\n\n### How do you add a draft watermark to your accounts\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 5 Aug, 2021 at  3:15 PM\n\n\t\tNavigation: Accounts Production > Select Client > Reports > Annual Accounts\n\nPlease click here to watch how to add a watermark to your accounts\n\nHelp/Guide: \n\nWhen creating a set of accounts you can download them with a draft watermark.\n\nPlease first create your annual accounts.\n\nPlease click here to find out how to create a set of annual accounts\n\nOnce your accounts are created please click on the green report settings button\n\nThe following pop up will appear\n\nplease click 'show draft message' then click save\n\nAfter saving please click on the report you would like the draft mark on and click the regenerate button.\n\nOnce the report is regenerated please download the PDF by clicking on the blue PDF button\n\nThe following watermark will now be shown on the PDF report\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
